### 20. DATABASE SECURITY

Enable and test row-level security on all user-owned tables.

Implement policies for:
- Profiles.
- Trips.
- Itinerary days.
- Activities.
- Expenses.
- Trip members.
- Invitations.
- AI generation records.
- Saved destinations.

Requirements:
- Users can access their own private trips.
- Shared access follows membership roles.
- Only permitted users can edit shared content.
- Only owners can delete shared trips or change ownership-related permissions.
- Expense access follows the intended sharing policy.
- Invitation tokens expire and cannot be reused after acceptance.
- Private data cannot be accessed by changing a URL or request ID.
- Public visitors cannot read private trip records.
- Service-role credentials never reach the browser.

Test authorization using separate user accounts and database policies.

